<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-24T02:26:43.535Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:26:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces quietly relaunched the previously failed Banooda operation, moving a major troop convoy while the Defence Minister announced the killing of nearly 285 al-Shabaab members, including 12 leaders, in operations across Bay, Shabelle and Hiiraan. The United States conducted airstrikes against al-Shabaab at three locations in Somalia, and President Museveni of Uganda met with Somalia's President to discuss regional security and the transition of the African Union peacekeeping mission, while the Uganda army chief visited Somali troops amid a withdrawal from Barawe. Somalia warned that unrest in Ethiopia could weaken security operations involving the African Union mission. The conflict produced 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxOSnVXZTRHeHhvcHhsZGVHNENMZWphYWdZZGxfdmE1NUVKRlB6YUdQT0tlZnZqX0hlYWx6cmdyeHl0NmktNXc5Q2d0RlNzTEhhMjZWUmxnX1NTNm1kNjBscEFkaEdCYWM2UFd0cWRtWXZLaTZheWVMTTlUblRGeWlacnM3NWkxeXdEUkRraVZnbWs3M3FzLTdSMnd4UC1yNUtaLWh3allFMVVEb2ZIR0RxYWxSQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE5vdjZUR2NpZnRyQnBLX0k3RDZfM0NLUEFRcFY3cmxBaDRXVzNMTnBSU2R2b1ZEUnBNREhwd3BaVnFLZm9oTTBBUE5vN2FVNkRETjdMUGxMTkVFcGh6cVNzT2JSeUEtSDNfQWpkOG1sZTE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxOUlRJWUU0aUFsUUlOYUY5SEdJU1dJam1fQVR4WU52OHJQZS1sTExweDJ1Z1hkOFlQc2R6cTZLYkVaclViVU11cUpoRUdrbTRWR0M0VmFXSmY2UlJ5V3BCSU05TWNnUWJEM3NYU29wbGJ5XzNaZWhWU2ZCVHJFZ1ZUMk04YkdVX2hBc19RdGFRN2dDTVh6Rjh0UjJoZmxlM0hVcGFjX0ZPOUVSWVdKTEJtVzdoLUY4emRDdVFvQUhWeVZYbkEtSGpKanp3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOcUlYN0VNdEpkV0IzN29ySWxtbTktR1BmN2